UID:c874bc38-f38e-55b5-8cfe-74a7f622881e@pghwidget
DTSTAMP:20261004T220327Z
SUMMARY:Oktoberfest Pittsburgh (Prostburgh)
DTSTART:20261004T160000Z
DTEND:20261005T000000Z
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;UNTIL=20261011T160000Z
LOCATION:Fort Duquesne Boulevard & Market Square\, Downtown Pittsburgh
DESCRIPTION:Oktoberfest Pittsburgh returns for more brews and bratwurst\, transforming downtown into a Bavarian village. Highlights include a 60-foot Ferris wheel\, stein-holding competitions\, Dachshund Races\, a doggie costume parade\, a chicken dance\, and axe throwing.\\n\\nhttps://www.visitpittsburgh.com/events-festivals/oktoberfest-pittsburgh/
URL:https://www.visitpittsburgh.com/events-festivals/oktoberfest-pittsburgh/
END:VEVENT
