DESCRIPTION:A staple of the Pittsburgh film scene\, this festival highlights queer filmmakers and stories with their multi-day festival that takes over Carnegie Mellon University in October.\\n\\nhttps://www.visitpittsburgh.com/blog/fall-fairs-festivals-and-events/
